# --- Installer build output -------------------------------------------------
# The staged payload is ~1.7 GB and the compiled setup ~470 MB, both regenerable
# from `Installer\build\build-installer.ps1`. Neither belongs in git (GitHub
# rejects any single file over 100 MB outright); ship the setup executable as a
# release asset instead.

